    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcanus Legends</strong> <strong>craft any spell</strong> imaginable and <strong>rebuild villages</strong> while facing epic challenges in a magical universe. <strong>Arcanus Legends</strong> is a <strong>single player &amp;</strong> <strong>online co-op action RPG</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Spell Crafting System</strong>: In Arcanus Legends, magic is not just a tool, but a canvas for players to unleash their creativity. With a robust spell crafting system, players can customize and create spells using various modifiers. These modifiers can be found through quests, challenges or exploring the dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Village Building</strong>: Collect mystical runes to bring back the town's inhabitants and their homes from the timeless dimension. Witness the town evolve and thrive under your magical influence.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcanus Legends</strong> <strong>craft any spell</strong> imaginable and <strong>rebuild villages</strong> while facing epic challenges in a magical universe. <strong>Arcanus Legends</strong> is a <strong>single player &amp;</strong> <strong>online co-op action RPG</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Spell Crafting System</strong>: In Arcanus Legends, magic is not just a tool, but a canvas for players to unleash their creativity. With a robust spell crafting system, players can customize and create spells using various modifiers. These modifiers can be found through quests, challenges or exploring the dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Village Building</strong>: Collect mystical runes to bring back the town's inhabitants and their homes from the timeless dimension. Witness the town evolve and thrive under your magical influence.</p>",
